OL,3,GNEWSACCTV footage of suspected Omagh
OL,4,Abombers' car missing, inquiry hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV which should have captured the
OL,7,Fsuspected Omagh bombers' car had
OL,8,Ffootage missing, an inquiry into the
OL,9,Fexplosion has heard.
OL,11,FDet Ch Insp Ivan Gault was questioned
OL,12,Fby the inquiry's legal team about
OL,13,Fpolice investigations into the bombing.
OL,15,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,16,Fpregnant with twins, died in the
OL,17,Fbombing in the County Tyrone town on 15
OL,18,FAugust 1998 - the biggest single
OL,19,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
